OL,3,GNEWSANurse, 80, celebrates 60 years in
OL,4,Athe profession
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn 80-year-old nurse who has cared for
OL,7,Fpatients for 60 years said she "never
OL,8,Fwanted to do anything else" as she
OL,9,Fcelebrated six decades in the role.
OL,11,FVibeke Nicklin, from Prenton in Wirral,
OL,12,Foriginally only planned to move from
OL,13,FDenmark to the United Kingdom for a
OL,14,Fyear to work as an au pair.
OL,16,FBut after meeting her husband Roger,
OL,17,FVibeke decided to stay and has
OL,18,Fdedicated her life to working in the
OL,19,FNational Health Service ever since.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,407,400,260,160,0,100
