OL,3,GNEWSANurse, 80, celebrates 60 years in
OL,4,Athe profession
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I feel lucky to be healthy, I enjoy my
OL,7,Fjob and always have done, I've never
OL,8,Fwanted to do anything else," said
OL,9,FVibeke, who still works two overnight
OL,10,Fshifts each week.
